flowchart LR
  W[Wake word] --> V[Verify owner voice]
  V --> ASR[Offline transcription]
  ASR --> P[Typed command]
  A[Approved scheduled routine] --> SEC[Policy + Permissions]
  L[Opt-in learned proposal] --> APPROVAL[User review and approval]
  APPROVAL --> A
  P --> SEC
  SEC --> EXEC[Android APIs / Accessibility / Root Allowlist]
  EXEC --> LOG[Local outcome log]
